{"id":"aca_","lemma":"acá","pos":"adv","rank":613,"glosses":["here (in the speaker's location)","as of, up to (used with a time phrase to represent continuity up to the present)"],"ipa":"/aˈka/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Guergana-ac%C3%A1.wav","examples":[{"text":"Acá estoy otra vez.","en":"Here I am again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76946"},{"text":"Voy a dormir acá.","en":"I'll sleep here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441721"},{"text":"Vamos a esperar acá.","en":"We'll wait here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442279"},{"text":"Vengo acá a menudo.","en":"I come here often.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443893"},{"text":"Acá está la dirección.","en":"Here's the address.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449055"}]}